---
import profilePhoto from '../../assets/SK.jpg';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<section class="section about" id="about">
    <div class="about-container">
        <div class="about-content">
            <h2>More About Me.</h2>

            <p>
                I’m a Senior Software Engineer at the City of Philadelphia’s Office of Innovation &
                Technology, where I work on software that directly serves Philadelphia residents.
            </p>

            <p>
                My path here started with a computer science degree and nearly four years as a
                full-stack software engineer at JPMorgan Chase, but I’ve always been drawn to
                cities: how people move through them, who they serve, and who they leave out. That
                pull led me to pursue a Master of Urban Spatial Analytics at UPenn, where I deepened
                my skills in spatial data science, data engineering, and urban research applied to
                housing, transportation, and land use.
            </p>

            <p>
                I don't believe technology should be built in a vacuum. Being a good engineer or
                technologist means knowing how to work with stakeholders and communities, especially
                when it comes to the urban systems that shape daily life. That mindset, blending
                technical work with planning and public impact, is what's driving the next chapter
                of my career.
            </p>

            <!-- prettier-ignore -->
            <h3 class="contact">
                Want to chat? Contact me <a href="mailto:me@sujankakumanu.com">here</a> or on
                <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/sujankakumanu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn⧉</a>.
            </h3>
        </div>

        <Image src={profilePhoto} alt="Sujan Kakumanu" class="profile-image" loading="eager" />
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .about {
        background: #000;
        color: #fff;
    }

    .about-container {
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 400px;
        gap: 4rem;
        align-items: start;
    }
    .contact {
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
        font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', serif;
    }

    .profile-image {
        width: 23rem;
        height: 23rem;
        border-radius: 8px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 968px) {
        .about {
            padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
        }

        .about-container {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        img {
            max-width: 400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
    }
</style>
